   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Illuminated panels",
   "anchor": "svetelne-panely"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "A box with an aluminium frame whose front face is made of a translucent material. Several versions are available, including vinyl canvas and acrylic glass panels and a version with 3D lettering.",
   "anchor": "svetelne-panely"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Graphics: printed or cut graphics can be applied to the translucent surface. These options let you adapt the look of the panel to your needs and specific requirements.",
   "anchor": "svetelne-panely"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Material: aluminium frame and a back panel of aluminium or sandwich board. Front face of acrylic glass or translucent vinyl canvas, which ensures a long service life and excellent light transmission.",
   "anchor": "svetelne-panely"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Placement: illuminated panels are easy to mount on buildings or pylons.",
   "anchor": "svetelne-panely"
  },
  {
   "type": "a",
   "text": "Request a no-obligation quote",
