  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Acrylic glass inlays: protruding or backed",
   "anchor": "intarzie"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "The two versions differ in look and in price. It comes down to whether the characters sit above the surface of the panel or below it.",
   "anchor": "intarzie"
  },
  {
   "type": "a",
   "text": "How it’s made",
   "anchor": "intarzie"
  },
  {
   "type": "h3",
   "text": "Protruding acrylic glass inlay",
   "anchor": "intarzie"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "The characters sit above the panel surface and create a 3D effect. Openings are cut into the front face and illuminated characters of solid acrylic glass are set into them. The illuminated sides of the letters create an aura of light.",
   "anchor": "intarzie"
  },
  {
   "type": "h3",
   "text": "Backed acrylic glass inlay",
   "anchor": "intarzie"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "The characters sit below the panel surface. This is the more economical option, because the characters do not have to be shaped and production is less labour-intensive. This version does not create an aura of light.",
   "anchor": "intarzie"
  },
  {
   "type": "div",
   "text": "Low initial cost",
   "anchor": "reklamni-tabule"
  },
  {
   "type": "div",
   "text": "Fast delivery",
   "anchor": "reklamni-tabule"
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Advertising boards",
   "anchor": "reklamni-tabule"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "An advertising board, or non-illuminated sign panel, is one of the simplest advertising solutions there is. And it stays flexible – the graphics on the board can be re-applied at any time.",
   "anchor": "reklamni-tabule"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Graphics: the message on the surface can be produced with printed or cut graphics, sandblasting and engraving.",
   "anchor": "reklamni-tabule"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Material: these are non-illuminated panels made from a range of materials such as aluminium, stainless steel, brass, composite materials, acrylates, glass, wood and the like.",
   "anchor": "reklamni-tabule"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Placement: marking premises, information or wayfinding purposes. Most often as non-illuminated signs, information boards, door plates, wayfinding systems and the like.",
   "anchor": "reklamni-tabule"
  },
  {
   "type": "a",
   "text": "Request a no-obligation quote",
   "anchor": "reklamni-tabule"
  },
