  {
   "type": "div",
   "text": "Easy to change",
   "anchor": "menuboardy"
  },
  {
   "type": "div",
   "text": "Long service life",
   "anchor": "menuboardy"
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Menu boards/info boards",
   "anchor": "menuboardy"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "Menu boards are special panels with interchangeable artwork. They can be double-sided for easy changing.",
   "anchor": "menuboardy"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Graphics: they let you display current offers using interchangeable artwork. The graphics are easy to change and adapt.",
   "anchor": "menuboardy"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Material: durable materials that ensure a long service life. The materials are designed for changing graphics and for use in restaurants.",
   "anchor": "menuboardy"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Placement: used above all in fast-food restaurants, where they display the current food and drink offer.",
   "anchor": "menuboardy"
  },
  {
   "type": "a",
   "text": "Request a no-obligation quote",
